        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat pump, air-water, 50kW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat pump, air-water, 50kW
Inventory for the production of an air-water heat pump, 50kW with a life time of 20 years.;
Synonyms: Wärmepumpe mit Wärmetauscher Luft/ Wasser 50kW; 
UUID: 893b3fa6-edab-3d4c-907c-5e93ea5aa174
Infrastructure of the air-water heat pump including all material inputs (pipes, air heat exchanger, coolant) and also the energy use for the construction of the heat pump components.
Location: Data apply to the supply in Switzerland.
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data provided by manufacturer 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_893b3fa6-edab-3d4c-907c-5e93ea5aa174.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
